Files in this directory are NEVER committed (see .gitignore); only this README is.

  grub-password.hash   output of `grub-mkpasswd-pbkdf2` (the grub.pbkdf2.sha512... line,
                       or the whole output). Optional: without it each build gets a
                       random GRUB password nobody knows. See README "Setting the GRUB password".

Anything here is copied into images and ISOs built from this config. Don't upload
those builds anywhere public.
